---
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
---

<section
    id="discord"
    class="py-24 bg-[#2d2d2d] text-center relative overflow-hidden"
>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <h2
            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-4"
        >
            <i class="fab fa-discord text-[#5865F2]"></i> Únete a nuestra Comunidad
        </h2>
        <p
            class="text-xl text-[#b0b0b0] mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
        >
            ¡Somos nuevos, pero estamos listos. Soporte 24/7, actualizaciones
            constantes y una comunidad que recién comienza.!
        </p>
        <div
            class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 mb-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto"
        >
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 p-4">
                <i
                    class="fas fa-headset text-3xl text-white bg-[#404040] w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
                ></i>
                <span class="text-[#b0b0b0] font-medium">Soporte Seguro</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 p-4">
                <i
                    class="fas fa-bell text-3xl text-white bg-[#404040] w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
                ></i>
                <span class="text-[#b0b0b0] font-medium"
                    >Notificaciones de Actualizaciones</span
                >
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 p-4">
                <i
                    class="fas fa-users text-3xl text-white bg-[#404040] w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
                ></i>
                <span class="text-[#b0b0b0] font-medium">Nueva Comunidad</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 p-4">
                <i
                    class="fas fa-gift text-3xl text-white bg-[#404040] w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
                ></i>
                <span class="text-[#b0b0b0] font-medium">Eventos y Sorteos</span
                >
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap">
            <Button href="https://discord.gg/JKPUVf9aeU" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-discord"></i> Unirse al Server Principal
            </Button>
            <Button
                variant="outline"
                href="https://discord.gg/JKPUVf9aeU"
                target="_blank"
            >
                <i class="fas fa-headset"></i> Canal de Ayuda
            </Button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
